    {
      "text": "When configuring the File Type Control policy, Zscaler recommends using:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Caution action for Executable downloads from websites under any URL category",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Block action for Executable uploads to websites under any URL category",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "If you have Advanced Sandbox, you can configure your Sandbox policy to quarantine executable downloads for the first-time action."
    },
    {
      "text": "Depending on your corporate policy, you can also add additional rules to block downloads from specific URL categories, such as Adult Material, Drugs, Gambling, Illegal or Questionable, Militancy/Hate and Extremism, Tasteless, Violence, and Weapons/Bombs, etc."
    },
    {
